<title>USA: Innovex chief operating officer retires.</title>
<headline>Innovex chief operating officer retires.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINS, Minn. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovex Inc said Monday Dale Johnson has retired as its chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Johnson, an Innovex employee for 10 years, took the chief operating officer position in 1995. Innovex said Johnson will remain as an employee of the company for an additional two years, assisting with matters related to Innovex's fine wire technologies.</p>
<p>Innovex manufactures electrical components for computer electronics and medical instruments.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
